# Sector Rotation ML Strategy

A modular, unattended-runnable pipeline that trains per-asset classifiers (Random Forest, SVM, DNN) on technical indicators, backtests their signals on held-out data, and allocates across sectors using a macro-driven long/short threshold — with a recession stress-test scenario on top.

Refactored from a single-notebook prototype into testable modules with no interactive prompts, no hardcoded secrets, and no blocking plot calls.

> [!WARNING]
> **Research code. Do not trade this.** The sector-level long/short decision currently uses realized backtest returns as its own input, which makes the reported portfolio P&L circular and unachievable. See [Known issues](#known-issues) before drawing any conclusion from the output.

