| `--start-date` | `2021-01-01` | Start of the data window (`YYYY-MM-DD`) |
| `--end-date` | `2024-01-31` | End of the data window, exclusive |
| `--initial-investment` | `100000000` | Notional capital, equal-weighted across sectors |
| `--test-size` | `0.3` | Trailing fraction of each asset's history held out for out-of-sample evaluation |
| `--log-level` | `INFO` | `DEBUG` \| `INFO` \| `WARNING` \| `ERROR` |

Every parameter is a flag — there are no `input()` prompts, so this runs fine under cron, Airflow, CI, or as a container entrypoint.

