## Configuration

The sector → ticker universe lives in `SECTORS` in `config.py` as plain data, so it can move to YAML/JSON later without touching any logic. FRED series IDs are in `FRED_SERIES`.

Threshold behaviour (`macro.calculate_dynamic_threshold`) starts from `base_threshold` (12%) and applies every condition that holds, cumulatively:

| Condition | Adjustment |
|---|---|
| YoY inflation > 2.5% | −2 |
| Fed funds rate > 3.0% | −3 |
| Annualized GDP growth > 3.0% | +2 |

Recession shocks in `stress_test.py` are illustrative percentage-point adjustments, not calibrated to historical data.

